'''Viking Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]] doubles his health and grants him [[Area Attack]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.5 Update|Version 10.5]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], Viking Cat is unlocked into the Rare Capsule pool once clearing [[Saudi Arabia (Empire of Cats)|Saudi Arabia]].

