==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Viking Cat was a part of another [[Cat Combo]] called [[Helmetheads (Removed Combo)|Helmetheads]].
*Prior to [[Version 15.7 Update|Version 15.7]], Viking Cat's descriptions read as follows:
<pre>Viking Cat
A combat-class Cat that has
read too many fantasy novels.
Strong against Red enemies.</pre>
<pre>Thor Cat
Having found the internet, this Cat
had its armour and weapon order made.
Strong against Red enemies.</pre>
<pre>Maximum the Fighter
Turns out his "order made" armor is a
knockoff brand. Even the cheap stuff is still
enough to hit Red for massive Area dmg.</pre>
**Maximum the Fighter's original description said it dealt Massive Area Damage to Red, although he doesn't have the [[Massive Damage]] ability.
*Thor Cat is named after [[wikipedia:Thor|Thor]], Norse God of sky and thunder. Thor Cat wielding a hammer is a reference to Thor's [[wikipedia:Mjölnir|Mjölnir]].
*Viking Cat's desire to live in an RPG may reference the human Viking Cat in [[Cat Clan Heroes (Uber Rare Cat)|Cat Clan Heroes]].
*"Maximum The Fighter" is a pun on Maximum Fighter.

